    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The dev-guide is large, dense, and often written by subject-matter-experts.",
      "source_hash": 16751714314917373586,
      "context_hash": 7194802525269993381,
      "translation": "dev-guide는 방대하고 밀도가 높으며, 종종 해당 분야 전문가들이 작성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:07:26.549079Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Occasionally, maintainers and anyone else who's interested will read through existing chapters to try and understand them.",
      "source_hash": 568667954369187749,
      "context_hash": 4408970102636385577,
      "translation": "때때로 관리자들과 관심 있는 사람이라면 누구나 기존 장을 함께 읽으며 이해하려 시도합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:07:26.549079Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
